---
// AutomateX Testimonial Section: Client Proof with 4.9/5 Star Rating & Grid Cards
---

<section class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden bg-[#FAF8F5]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Title & Rating Header -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-14 md:mb-18">
      
      <div class="space-y-3.5 max-w-2xl text-left">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-purple-200 bg-purple-50/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-[#5B21B6]">
          <span>Clients testimonials</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#100F12] tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
          Trusted by teams building real workflows
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Rating Badge (Right) -->
      <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start md:items-end gap-1 shrink-0 text-left md:text-right">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-base">★★★★★</div>
          <span class="text-lg font-black text-[#100F12] font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans']">4.9/5</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#5F5E6E]">Review by 356 users worldwide</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Bento Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Alex Morgan (6 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6 bg-white border border-[#EBE8E3] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between text-left">
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium mb-6">
          "Agents now handle first responses, summaries, and routing. Our team focuses on edge cases instead of repetitive work."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699e67c2833e027c5f3c4c06_avatar-18.jpg" alt="Alex Morgan" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200" />
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Alex Morgan</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E]">Head of Operations</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-600 bg-purple-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">FinTech</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Priya Shah (6 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6 bg-white border border-[#EBE8E3] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between text-left">
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium mb-6">
          "Knowing exactly what the agent did and why made it easy to roll this out across teams without risk."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699e67c2efcd5f43b908ec38_avatar-19.jpg" alt="Priya Shah" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200" />
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Priya Shah</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#5F5E6E]">Product Manager</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">SaaS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Daniel Brooks (4 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white border border-[#EBE8E3] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between text-left">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium mb-6">
          "We started with a PM agent, then customized it as workflows evolved. No rebuilding from scratch."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699e73c62a9fbb66eaa9069d_avatar-16.jpg" alt="Daniel Brooks" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Daniel Brooks</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5F5E6E]">Engineering Lead</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Sarah Kim (4 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white border border-[#EBE8E3] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between text-left">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium mb-6">
          "Before this, every team handled requests differently. Now we have consistent workflows with clear approvals."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699d21f40954a36bd5129a46_avatar-01.jpg" alt="Sarah Kim" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Sarah Kim</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5F5E6E]">Program Manager</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Michael Torres (4 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white border border-[#EBE8E3] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(20,15,40,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_18px_40px_rgba(99,91,255,0.08)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between text-left">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#100F12] leading-relaxed font-medium mb-6">
          "Guardrails and human approvals made it safe to automate real workflows, not just demos."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69982176124aec6884c510af/699d21f47ea12762029a2fa4_avatar-05.jpg" alt="Michael Torres" class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-200" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#100F12]">Michael Torres</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-[#5F5E6E]">IT Operations Lead</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
